@startuml UC-P3-list-and-open-a-project-analysis-sequence
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
hide footbox
title UC-P3 List and open a project (analysis: system sequence)
' Analysis level (decision 9): the person and Playground as one box. No outside system takes part.
' Alpha scope (decision 13): a user sees the projects they belong to, an administrator sees all.
' No route, store, port, adapter, token or cookie. Step numbers are the main flow numbers of UC-P3.

actor "Person" as U
note over U, PG : Opening a project is a second request, after the list.
participant "Playground" as PG #E6F0FB

U -> PG : 1 ask for my projects
PG -> PG : 2 check the account
||20||
PG --> U : 3 the projects: a user's own (maybe none),\nall of them for an administrator
||30||
U -> PG : 4 open one project
alt neither a member nor an administrator,\nno such project, or a bad id
  PG --> U : 5 the same answer for both,\nas for a missing project
else
  ||20||
  PG --> U : 6 its name, its members and\nempty lists of files, endpoints\nand evaluations
end
@enduml
